(342, 7, 'reading', 'What does the speaker do?', '["Introduce a new app", "Sell a car", "Teach English", "Repair phones"]', 0, 'Giới thiệu app quản lý chi tiêu mới.', 'comprehension', 'it', 614, 'Hi everyone! Today I want to introduce MoneyTrack, our new expense-tracking app. Simply scan your receipts and the app sorts them automatically. It is free for the first year. Download it from the App Store or Google Play today!'),
