(345, 7, 'reading', 'What is the workshop about?', '["Negotiation skills", "Cooking", "Driving", "Painting"]', 0, 'Hội thảo kỹ năng đàm phán cho nhân viên sales.', 'comprehension', 'sales', 615, 'SALES WORKSHOP\n\nJoin our one-day negotiation skills workshop on August 10th. Learn proven techniques from expert Ms. Fiona Gray. The fee is $80, including lunch and materials. Seats are limited to 30 — register early at sales@company.example.com.'),
