(348, 7, 'reading', 'Why was the road closed?', '["A marathon", "An accident", "Construction", "A parade"]', 0, 'Đóng đường vì giải marathon sáng Chủ nhật.', 'comprehension', 'general', 616, 'TRAFFIC NOTICE\n\nCentral Avenue will be closed this Sunday from 6 a.m. to noon for the city marathon. Drivers should use Riverside Road instead. Buses 12 and 15 will be rerouted. We apologize for the inconvenience.'),
