(351, 7, 'reading', 'What does the ad offer?', '["Free English trial lesson", "Free gym trial", "Free lunch", "Free haircut"]', 0, 'Học thử tiếng Anh giao tiếp miễn phí.', 'comprehension', 'general', 617, 'SPEAK UP ENGLISH CENTER\n\nNew students get one free trial lesson in business conversation. Classes run every evening from 6 p.m. to 9 p.m. Our center is on the second floor of Vincom Plaza. Call 090-123-4567 to book your seat today!'),
