(354, 7, 'reading', 'What is the main news?', '["A new factory opening", "A factory closing", "A strike", "A fire"]', 0, 'Khai trương nhà máy mới tạo 500 việc làm.', 'comprehension', 'manufacturing', 618, 'NEW FACTORY OPENS\n\nSora Electronics opened a new factory in Bac Ninh province yesterday. The $20 million plant will employ 500 workers. The company plans to export 80 percent of its products to Europe and America.'),
